[list]
[*] Closing the gate skips anyone still inside out next to it.
[*] If the caster dies, the pocket collapses and its contents spill out near the body.
[*] The gate closes when a gravship takes off; the pocket itself is kept.
[*] Find it on VPE's Arcanum tab.
[/list]

